  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A helicopter is moving towards a stationary observer in a straight line and its loudspeaker emits a sound of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{h}\"></span>. The speed of the helicopter is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.2c\"></span> where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span> is the speed of sound. What is the frequency of the sound emitted by the loudspeaker as detected by the observer?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5f_{h}}{6}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{6f_{h}}{5}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5f_{h}}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4f_{h}}{5}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
